==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Baa Baa]]s spawn after 6 seconds<sup>180f</sup>, delay 8~16 seconds<sup>240f~480f</sup>.
*2 [[Sir Seal]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 20~40 seconds<sup>600f~1,200f</sup>.
*1 [[Le'boin]] spawns after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>.
*2 [[Sir Seal]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 20~40 seconds<sup>600f~1,200f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Sir Seal]]s spawn after 180 seconds<sup>5,400f</sup>, delay 20~40 seconds<sup>600f~1,200f</sup>.
*3 [[Ghost Doge]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 120~124 seconds<sup>3,600f~3,720f</sup>.
*3 [[Ghost Snache]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 126.67~130.67 seconds<sup>3,800f~3,920f</sup>.
*3 [[Ghost Baa Baa]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 133.33~137.33 seconds<sup>4,000f~4,120f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn after 4 seconds<sup>120f</sup>, delay 6~12 seconds<sup>180f~360f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 2 seconds<sup>60f</sup>, delay 2~8 seconds<sup>60f~240f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn after 2 seconds<sup>60f</sup>, delay 2~8 seconds<sup>60f~240f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

